  "a new dawn 花緑青が明ける日に|2025": {"id":1279865,"poster":"/wIXWBILvfweBOPfnOsaK71AFtXm.jpg","title":"花緑青が明ける日に","title_en":"A New Dawn","overview_en":"Keitaro lives in a fireworks factory that is about to be shut down. He is determined to unravel the mystery of the Shuhari, a mythical firework created by his father before he disappeared without a trace – and launch it before the factory closes.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,18],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt32192760","imdb_votes":42},
