  "creepy crypt preview: weapons|*": {"id":1078605,"poster":"/aOTZOU3aI5SDELJz5YpAkB0wFDH.jpg","title":"Weapons - Die Stunde des Verschwindens","title_en":"Weapons","overview":"Mit einer einzigen Ausnahme verschwinden eines Nachts alle Kinder einer Schulklasse zur exakt gleichen Zeit auf mysteriöse Weise. Die Bewohner der betroffenen Gemeinde stehen vor der Frage, wer oder was hinter dem rätselhaften Verschwinden steckt.","overview_en":"When all but one child from the same class mysteriously vanish on the same night at exactly the same time, a community is left questioning who or what is behind their disappearance.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[27,9648],"vote_average":7.3,"vote_count":3477,"imdb_id":"tt26581740","rt_critic":93,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/weapons","imdb_rating":7.4,"imdb_votes":349399},
